### 결제안 API 간단 점검용 요청 모음

@pay-url = http://localhost:8082
@roomId = 1
@roomSessionId = 1
@myUserId = 1

### 1. 계좌 거래 내역 조회
POST {{pay-url}}/api/v1/expenses/account-history
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-Id: {{myUserId}}

{}

### 2. 결제안 등록
POST {{pay-url}}/api/v1/rooms/{{roomId}}/expenses
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-Id: {{myUserId}}

{
  "roomId": {{roomId}},
  "roomSessionId": {{roomSessionId}},
  "title": "저녁 정산",
  "totalAmount": 120000,
  "paidAt": "2026-03-12T14:30:00",
  "inputType": "MANUAL",
  "participants": [
    { "userId": {{myUserId}}, "userName": "결제자", "userTag": "#1A3", "splitAmount": 40000 },
    { "userId": 2, "userName": "참여자2", "userTag": "#2B4", "splitAmount": 40000 },
    { "userId": 3, "userName": "참여자3", "userTag": "#3C5", "splitAmount": 40000 }
  ]
}

### 3. 모임방 결제안 목록 조회
GET {{pay-url}}/api/v1/rooms/{{roomId}}/expenses
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-Id: {{myUserId}}

### 4. 내가 생성한 결제안 목록 조회
GET {{pay-url}}/api/v1/rooms/{{roomId}}/expenses/me
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-Id: {{myUserId}}
